<title>AUSTRIA: Readymix concentrates Austrian activities.</title>
<headline>Readymix concentrates Austrian activities.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Readymix RMC Group Plc will concentrate its activities in Austria by merging its Kies-Union and Lieferbeton units, Kies-Union said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Austria's biggest supplier of sand and gravel Kies-Union and concrete firm Lieferbeton will form Readymix-Kies-Union AG . RMC will control 72 percent of the new firm.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-25</p>
